==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|bismerwen}}, from {{inh|en|ang|besmirwan}}, {{m|ang|besmierwan||to besmear}}, equivalent to {{prefix|en|be|smear}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|besmeren||to besmear}}, {{cog|de|beschmieren||to besmear}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|en|ɪə(ɹ)|s=3}}

